    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About these fixtures",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": null,
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# Tern fixtures\n\nThis dashboard exercises every panel type the **tern-grafana** plugin renders natively.\n\n- timeseries: multi-series, stacking, thresholds, units\n- stat, gauge, bargauge, table\n- logs, heatmap, state-timeline\n- rows (open and collapsed), a library panel\n\nSee [the dev stack docs](https://github.com/contrafy/tern-grafana/blob/master/docs/dev-stack.md).",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      }
    },
